---
const signals = [
	'noticed the last 8 unassigned follow-ups',
	'requested status 11 times without being asked to',
	'retains full client context',
	'historically intervenes 2–4 days before deadlines',
	'has never allowed this category of work to fail',
];
---

<section id="routing" class="border-b border-line">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:py-28">
		<div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.15fr] lg:items-center lg:gap-16">
			<div class="reveal">
				<p class="eyebrow">Reliable Person Routing™</p>
				<h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl">
					When ownership is unclear, OaaS resolves it.
				</h2>
				<p class="mt-5 text-[16.5px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
					Assignment fields can be empty. Teams can disagree. Escalation paths can loop. It
					doesn't matter. Reliable Person Routing™ predicts which team member is most likely
					to intervene before the work fails — and routes ownership directly to them.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-4 text-[16.5px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
					Every inference is backed by observed behavior. Every resolution is fully
					auditable. Nothing is ever dropped, because the router selects for exactly one
					property: <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">the historical refusal to let
					things fail.</strong>
				</p>
				<p class="mt-6 font-mono text-sm text-accent">
					The work always finds an owner.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Resolution record -->
			<div class="reveal console" aria-label="Example ownership resolution record">
				<div
					class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-console-line bg-console-soft px-5 py-3"
				>
					<span class="console-label">Resolution record</span>
					<span class="console-label">#04187</span>
				</div>
				<div class="px-5 py-6 sm:px-6">
					<div class="grid grid-cols-[8.5rem_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-3">
						<span class="console-label pt-0.5">Task</span>
						<span class="console-value">Client follow-up — Meridian renewal</span>

						<span class="console-label pt-0.5">Assigned owner</span>
						<span class="console-value text-console-dim">—</span>

						<span class="console-label pt-0.5">Team owner</span>
						<span class="console-value">Delivery</span>

						<span class="console-label pt-0.5">Inferred owner</span>
						<span class="console-value font-medium text-signal">Gabriel R.</span>

						<span class="console-label pt-0.5">Confidence</span>
						<span class="console-value tabular-nums">97%</span>
					</div>

					<div class="mt-5 border-t border-console-line pt-5">
						<span class="console-label">Signals</span>
						<ul class="mt-3 space-y-2">
							{
								signals.map((signal) => (
									<li class="console-value flex gap-2.5 leading-relaxed">
										<span class="text-signal" aria-hidden="true">
											•
										</span>
										{signal}
									</li>
								))
							}
						</ul>
					</div>

					<div class="mt-5 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-console-line pt-4">
						<span class="console-label">Resolution</span>
						<span class="console-value text-signal">Routed · 1.2s</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
